  "result": "I'm wrapping up the archive search. The closest match is PowerToys#37298, so I'm writing the answer from it.\n\n{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#37298\"], \"answer\": \"This has been reported before. The File Explorer preview pane doesn't re-render an SVG that is already loaded when you switch Windows between dark and light mode. As a workaround, hide and re-show the preview pane, or close and reopen the Explorer window, after changing the theme. The preview then picks up the new theme. PowerToys#37298 is the same request, asking for the pane to update immediately, and it has no fix or comments yet. Your wish to keep the SVG preview always in light mode is a related request about SVG backgrounds (for example PowerToys#20578 and PowerToys#21561), but I haven't confirmed it was implemented.\"}",
